  "code": "// @IL.name maps these onto the PascalCase names EF Core's conventions expect.\n@IL.name(\"Product\")\nclass PRODUCT is\n    @IL.name(\"Id\")\n    id: int public;\n\n    @IL.name(\"Name\")\n    name: string public;\n\n    init() is si\nsi\n\nclass STORE_CONTEXT: DbContext is\n    @IL.name(\"Products\")\n    products: DbSet[PRODUCT];\n\n    init(options: DbContextOptions) is\n        super.init(options);\n    si\nsi\n\nadd_product(context: STORE_CONTEXT, product: PRODUCT) -> Tasks.TASK is\n    context.products.add(product);\n\n    await context.save_changes_async(System.Threading.CancellationToken.none);\n\n    return;\nsi",
  "fullSource": "use Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.DbContext;\nuse Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.DbSet;\nuse Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore.DbContextOptions;\n\n// @IL.name maps these onto the PascalCase names EF Core's conventions expect.\n@IL.name(\"Product\")\nclass PRODUCT is\n    @IL.name(\"Id\")\n    id: int public;\n\n    @IL.name(\"Name\")\n    name: string public;\n\n    init() is si\nsi\n\nclass STORE_CONTEXT: DbContext is\n    @IL.name(\"Products\")\n    products: DbSet[PRODUCT];\n\n    init(options: DbContextOptions) is\n        super.init(options);\n    si\nsi\n\nadd_product(context: STORE_CONTEXT, product: PRODUCT) -> Tasks.TASK is\n    context.products.add(product);\n\n    await context.save_changes_async(System.Threading.CancellationToken.none);\n\n    return;\nsi\n\nentry() is si\n",
